{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52310","headline":"诗（幷序） 七十一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 七十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官职亦须求，钱财亦须觅。\n天雨麻点孔，三年着一滴。\n王相（张改作「妄想」）逢便宜，参差着局席。\n[兀兀]（瓦瓦）舍底坐，饿你眠（张改作「眼」）赫赤（戴校「饶你眼赫赫」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}